# The input test script for tests/guest/evdev.c (engine/evdev.c, --input-script). "ms dev type code value":
# the time in ms from the first open of a device, dev 0 the touchscreen and dev 1 the keyboard.
# At 0 ms: one touch (slot 0 down at 360,640 with pressure 80, then the frame's SYN_REPORT), and a key A tap.
0 0 3 47 0
0 0 3 57 7
0 0 3 53 360
0 0 3 54 640
0 0 3 58 80
0 0 1 330 1
0 0 0 0 0
0 1 1 30 1
0 1 0 0 0
0 1 1 30 0
0 1 0 0 0
# At 300 ms: the Back key on the keyboard (the page's Escape), for the epoll wait.
300 1 1 158 1
300 1 0 0 0
300 1 1 158 0
300 1 0 0 0
# At 600 ms: the Menu key, for the epoll wait that follows the Back key's read.
600 1 1 139 1
600 1 0 0 0
600 1 1 139 0
600 1 0 0 0
